# Web Console Conventions

## RTL / Persian

- App is Persian-first: `lang="fa"` `dir="rtl"` (see `index.html`).
- Use Vazirmatn / existing Jalali helpers; do not switch to Latin-only UI chrome.
- Technical fields (URLs, paths, IDs, code, JSON) should use `dir="ltr"` where the codebase already does.

## Auth clients

- Fetch with `credentials: 'include'`.
- Mutations send `x-csrf-token` from the session CSRF helper (see `cdeApi.ts`, `apiConsoleApi.ts`).
- Do **not** send forgeable role/context headers; AuthZ is cookie/session based.
- Do not re-enable or expand the IS login tab for v1.

## Structure

- Routes/gates: `src/App.tsx`, `sessionStore.ts`.
- API clients: `src/services/{cdeApi,apiConsoleApi,isApi}.ts`.
- Feature UI: `src/components/api-console/`, pages under `src/pages/`.
- `OnlineApiConsolePage.tsx` is a monolith — **surgical edits only**; no opportunistic E22 splits.

## Verify

- `npm run typecheck -w @api-console/web`
- `npm run test:web`
- Playwright (`npm run test:e2e -w @api-console/web`) when changing login, gate, or workspace routing.
